        "title": "Disturbingly drawing attention",
        "text": "Not being able to go to Varanasi on my journey across India, I was recommended visiting this place as a close but smaller equivalent in Nepal. \n\nA very interesting area to walk around, get lost in, as no clear direction of routes, as they want to sell guide services; I did not think it was necessary. \n\nDeers enclosure, Temples, stupas, with monkeys jumping into the river having fun, one Monastery not allowed for foreign visitors to enter. \n\nThe one - attention drawing even if very disturbing and making me extremely queasy was witnessing - not one but three cremation/ funeral proceedings at the river bank:-0 \n\nSat down and watched speechless. ",
